{
  "$comment": "Read by tools/check-scope.mjs. Track derived from the PR head branch prefix. 'shared/' branches are exempt (see docs/PARALLEL_WORK.md) since shared-infra PRs legitimately touch many paths; they're kept safe by review + size limits, not by this glob check.",
